OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does it means to be the Isle
OL,4,Aof Man's chief minister?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe newly elected members of the House
OL,7,Fof Keys are all set to vote for the
OL,8,FIsle of Man's next chief minister on
OL,9,FTuesday - with the privilege of leading
OL,10,Fthe island over the next five years.
OL,12,FThere are two candidates vying for the
OL,13,Ftop job in Manx politics, newcomer
OL,14,FKirrie Jenkins and Chris Thomas, who
OL,15,Fhas more than a decade of experience as
OL,16,Fan MHK.
OL,18,FThey will vote for their preferred
OL,19,Fcandidate in a special House of Keys
OL,20,Fsitting.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
